# Generated mini-RiVault per-job env files written at the repo root
# (shape env.<uuid>, carry LITELLM_*/VLLM_API_KEY). Anchored to the root and
# to the 8-4-4-4-12 hex shape so env.example / .env.template stay tracked.
/env.[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]-[0-9a-f]*-[0-9a-f]*-[0-9a-f]*-[0-9a-f]*

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# Terraform
